  <item>
    <title>Ep16. 2026年，让快乐成为我们的日常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6956badd2db086f8973b2b31</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6956badd2db086f8973b2b31</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2026年的第一期，我们从费代里奇书里的一句话开始聊起，</span><strong><br><span>相比幸福（happiness），我们更想谈谈欢乐（joy）。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>很多时候，我们被教导要追求一种“最终会到达的幸福”：</span><br><span>等事情完成了、目标实现了、痛苦忍过去了，</span><br><span>幸福好像就会在未来的某一天出现。</span><br><span>但在这期对话里，我们慢慢意识到：</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>欢乐并不是一种终点状态，</span><br><span>它更像是一种正在发生的过程。</span></strong><br><span></span></h2>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616600e645ae052aba6f7d13/lm0jiDWOg0T05P8qxDJBvY2f79Ff.m4a" length="50204747" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgEDKKFV0k45_y8Tl7ov5urwBgnc.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep15. 救命！原来预制菜不仅伤害了我的健康，还……</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d24d49522b40626cde4def</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d24d49522b40626cde4def</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Sep 2025 07:43:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>💬</span><strong><span>本期简介</span></strong><br><span>这一期我们来聊聊关于预制菜和自己做饭这件事。</span><br><span>一直自认为认真做饭的两个人，发现预制菜原来在身边无处不在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳</span><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">00:01:08</a>｜英国是欧洲最大的预制菜消费国</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">00:03:09</a>｜预制菜的历史：从TV Dinner到微波炉革命</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">00:06:12</a>｜我们为什么对预制菜感到强烈不适？是食材还是味道？</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">00:10:56</a>｜</span></strong><span>高端预制菜Dishpatch</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liDTNpiQS6wSrNxEIVtz4pgtWFi1.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lo0JToz8PLgJeXxtFK0V4BpfXdcV.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llNniHN78Yrn2qI_da1WXDq-rBUy.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">00:14:51</a>｜糖、盐、油背后的健康隐患：代谢性疾病的隐形推手</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">00:17:25</a>｜当年稀缺的黄桃罐头，如今变成了垃圾食品</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">00:21:09</a>｜方便食品的崛起，是城市节奏与996的副产品？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">00:25:10</a>｜“吃饭没那么重要”，是工作伦理带来的误区？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">00:28:53</a>｜做饭，是生活中少有的交流机会</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">00:38:16</a>｜我们如何好好吃饭？从配料表开始</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">00:44:24</a>｜新手就从一份 open sandwich 开始（详细的操作步骤已经更新到筐筐的小红书啦）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBufBivVtdAs_22zQrVcG332nWJ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>✂️</span><strong><span>后期制作：MK</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍欢迎来小某书找我们玩：</span></strong><br><span>MK刚刚更新了名字</span><br><span>筐筐很日常</span></p><span></span><p><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616600e645ae052aba6f7d13/lsYrt0detY4HJvPj2mzjT3atkMjd.m4a" length="65985711" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjkckPO6ST5dBo0kUj7jtTGS9EhN.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep14. 焦虑和拖延总治不好？自查是完美主义者。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/688285daa12f9ff06ae395d3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">688285daa12f9ff06ae395d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Jul 2025 20:02:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一直纠结为什么老是拖延、焦虑，尝试了各种时间管理。后来才意识到，是因为我们对“完美”有太高的期待。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们就来聊聊完美主义，看看有没有什么自救方法，让自己轻松一些。</span></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a>｜焦虑 = 拖延？我也是完美主义者？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a>｜完美主义：我必须在太阳下山前去海边跑步</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a>｜用“微行动”打破完美主义</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a>｜目标很完美，但我一次都不做</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a>｜心理学定义：没有“完美”，而是“期待过高”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a>｜从自High到自知：行动才是解药</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a>｜不限定时间，我可以回两个小时邮件</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a>｜我是回避型完美主义者吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">24:39</a>｜标准高和完美主义的区别是什么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1856">30:56</a>｜自我接纳 = 接纳不完美的自己</span></li><span></span></ol>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616600e645ae052aba6f7d13/lrLwOZGnbW-Lnjk2x5eUHqF0-QRK.m4a" length="46745317" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrDUkZTZw2y6wRqMEMK7As3NknMY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep13(下). 与自己和解，10天冥想让我抱头痛哭|Vipassana止语内观体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6860585bbef90978ec622829</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6860585bbef90978ec622829</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Jun 2025 21:10:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果你对10天Vipassana的具体日程和安排感兴趣，可以先跳到Ep13(上)收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期 Vipassana 止语内观的后半集，MK 分享了冥想带来的改变、哭泣时的深层自我发现、与梦境互动的奇妙体验，以及那些被遗忘的童年记忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>内观不能解决人生问题，却给了他与自己和解的新方法。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:00:03</a></span><strong><span>冥想的改变是累积的</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">00:04:16</a></span><strong><span>Vipassana内观解决不了人生问题？</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">00:06:24</a></span><strong><span>对体验的期待与落差</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">00:11:34</a></span><strong><span>丧尸围聚（搞笑场景）</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">00:14:02</a></span><strong><span>突如其来的哭泣</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">00:20:26</a></span><strong><span>察觉到一直对自己有多苛刻</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">00:23:12</a></span><strong><span>别人也在哭</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">00:28:28</a></span><strong><span>不睡觉的寝室：蘑菇男与梦游哥</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2006">00:33:26</a></span><strong><span>似睡非睡：冥想让我进入的奇特状态</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">00:39:43</a></span><strong><span>那些被遗忘的童年记忆</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2445">00:40:45</a></span><strong><span>如果你也想参加Vipassana止语内观</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616600e645ae052aba6f7d13/liB_kTMhsnTZcSbTjaxEj6t49eu5.m4a" length="65027865" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhMoGDrhNzgfZ21zBexdtooIU6oe.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep13 (上). 跟90个陌生人一起闭嘴10天，是种什么体验？|Vipassana止语内观</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6848a3bdb23ed76e606485b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6848a3bdb23ed76e606485b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 21:38:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客是一期特别节目。在节目中，MK 分享了他参与十天 Vipassana 止语内观禅修的完整体验：从“十天不能说话”的挑战，到如何重新理解“痛苦”和“定力”。我们一起聊聊沉默、感官、欲望，以及他在冥想中体验到的“电流感”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📌 下半集将带来更多新奇的互动，遇见一些很特别的人，以及自我探索过程中那些奇妙的瞬间，敬请期待！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">00:01:27</a> 为什么会去参加 Vipassana？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">00:04:45</a> 出发前的准备</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">00:07:34</a> 真正的挑战不是不说话，而是内心太混乱<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">00:10:45</a> 如何参加 Vipassana？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="801">00:13:21</a> 每天的生活节奏是怎样的？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">00:19:37</a> 斋饭也可以很好吃</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1696">00:28:16</a> Vipassana 冥想技巧：从呼吸到电流感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">00:37:25</a> 痛苦的本质只是注意力的一种投射？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">00:41:05</a> 定力不是天赋，而是可以训练的能力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">00:45:20</a> 不说话后才发现：自我是由语言构建的</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚 本集提到的资料 &amp; 参考信息</span><br><span>🧘</span><strong><span> Vipassana 相关：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Vipassana 官网</span></strong><span>（全球统一报名平台）</span><br><span>👉 </span><a href="https://www.dhamma.org/" data-url="https://www.dhamma.org/"><span>www.dhamma.org</span></a><br><span>（支持多语言，可查看各国家和地区的禅修中心信息）</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>中国地区报名方式</span></strong><span>：</span><br><span>中国大陆的 Vipassana 中心不在 dhamma.org 上统一显示，建议通过“小红书搜索关键词 Vipassana”找到具体报名链接和经验分享。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>英国地区两个中心</span></strong><span>：</span><br><span>可参考 dhamma.org 中英国页面，提前两到三个月放出报名名额，免费参与，但需填写详细表单。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📺</span><strong><span> 人物/资料提及：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Goenka（S.N. Goenka）老师</span></strong><br><span>Vipassana 全球课程的视频主讲人，课程使用他生前录制的教学视频。视频中也包含幽默段子和佛法讲解。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎁</span><strong><span> 生活用品贴士（来自经验分享）：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>穿脱方便的鞋子</span></strong><span>：因为需要频繁进出冥想室与寝室，建议携带无鞋带、易脱穿的拖鞋或懒人鞋。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>自行携带床品</span></strong><span>：如枕套、床单、被罩，保障个人清洁。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>每日作息时间表</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGbnyp4IzDqqHbAQ_Sov-HvA1Uy.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616600e645ae052aba6f7d13/lj1VcHQx909-jOrg5N7ykwr_w49_.m4a" length="73350557" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsovQpq0M6S3YLQt_f_qzBgNlklK.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.12 轻断食20天能改变什么？我们自己试了一个月</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e849e98eecdbeb60f3d0e6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e849e98eecdbeb60f3d0e6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Mar 2025 00:10:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近看了《Fast like a Girl》，马上实战挑战了一个月的轻断食。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没想到过程不但没有想象中“痛苦”，反而感受到那种“自律”带来“自由”的快乐。</span><br><span>也像是重新学会怎么和身体好好相处～</span><br><span>顺带一提，减肥的效果也意外地不错😄</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对轻断食感兴趣，不妨先进来听听，然后自己可以尝试看看。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 我们为什么开始关注健康？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 第一次轻断食的失败经验</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a> 第一次24小时断食的感受</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 消除脑雾的方法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1286">21:26</a> 有氧运动与断食能共存吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 自律带来自由：不是强迫，而是自然过渡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a> 女生专属建议：结合周期进行轻断食</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期提及</span></strong><br><span></span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/book/36518654?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/book/36518654?dt_dapp=1"><span>《Fast Like A Girl》</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/book/36707112?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/book/36707112?dt_dapp=1"><span>《控糖革命》</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/book/36696538?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/book/36696538?dt_dapp=1"><span>《超越百岁》</span></a></p><span></span><p><br><span></span><br><span></span><strong><span>RSS添加</span></strong><br><span><a data-url="https://anchor.fm/s/6f7201a4/podcast/rss" href="https://anchor.fm/s/6f7201a4/podcast/rss">anchor.fm</a></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><strong><span>小宇宙 | QQ音乐 | 苹果播客 | Spotify | Google Podcast |</span></strong></p>]]></description>
