  <item>
    <title>Ep.11 聊出轨：亲密关系大考验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667f46cb5c33fe90f592a715</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667f46cb5c33fe90f592a715</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jun 2024 23:27:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>看了LTNS，终于找到机会互相试探一下对方的底线。</span><br><span>还好，聊完这期，我们的关系还健在。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 话题：出轨</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 电影：《Long Time No Sex》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> 肉体出轨 v.s 精神出轨</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> 思想实验：如果朋友出轨</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">36:27</a> 选对人的标准是什么？ </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2392">39:52</a> 理论一下：圣爱与欲爱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2873">47:53</a> 送命题：如何才能长久在一起？</span></p>]]></description>
