  <item>
    <title>Ep.08 以为可以在家开心过年，其实只能和父母吵架。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63cd9b0b6bcfd9410288ac52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63cd9b0b6bcfd9410288ac52</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Jan 2023 20:22:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好不容易回家过年，想象中全是阖家欢乐、其乐融融的景象。</span><br><span>但真实的场景也很可能是热闹的滑稽情景剧：</span><br><span>回家两天后，我们和父母可能就开始互相挑刺，无法和谐相处。</span></p><span></span><p><span>即使我们深爱父母，但要在假期里和父母好好相处，</span><br><span>也绝对是极大挑战。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>值此春节之际，我们竟然认真批判了父母的各种不是。</span><br><span>幸好我们的结论是自己拥有了太多的爱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有同感，那就快来听听，并聊一聊你在家过年的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听指南↓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a>回家过年的两难处境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a>母亲的身份</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a>琐碎引起冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a>如何与父母沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">24:57</a>完美父亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a>吐槽≠不爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提到的信息：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35358449/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35358449/"><span>电视剧《1883》</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35966120/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35966120/"><span>《始于极限》上野千鹤子&amp;铃木凉美</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span><br><span>片头：春节序曲</span><br><span>片尾：La Traviata: "Libiamo, ne’lieti calici"</span></p><span></span><p><span>可收听我们的节目：</span><br><span>小宇宙 | QQ音乐 | 苹果播客 | Spotify | Google Podcast</span></p>]]></description>
