  <item>
    <title>Ep. 07  搬家：归属感何处安放？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63b4b23a289d2739647d93d7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63b4b23a289d2739647d93d7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Jan 2023 22:54:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期来聊聊搬家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为突如其来的高频率正经搬家，我们迎来了2023年的全新生活，也让我们回头审视搬家到底让我们失去了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>搬家带来的到底是完美的新生活，还是脱离安全感的旅程？</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为搬家吵架，连录搬家主题的Podcast也让我们吵上了。搬家如同隔离一样，是考验情侣的最佳时期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为搬家远离的友谊，我们是否能好好的维系，要如何维系？</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听指南↓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 今年的两次搬家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a> 搬家很费感情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="779">12:59</a> 新生活是一种冒险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1308">21:48</a> 朋友对搬家的反应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 友情的“在地化”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a> 传统方法的深入联接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">37:35</a> 被迫极简生活，挖坑“断舍离”</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.douban.com/search?source=suggest&amp;q=%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90" data-url="https://www.douban.com/search?source=suggest&amp;q=%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%8E%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90"><span>《始于极限》上野千鹤子&amp;铃木良美</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35909128/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35909128/"><span>《论爱欲》汪民安</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15g411i7Pq/?buvid=Z44748489E04119F419799276B7575E13D41&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=7kLWX1yZyjZouEfzrH3%2B1g%3D%3D&amp;p=1&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=B4E59A52-ED93-4D1D-B208-DD52A82DC931&amp;share_source=COPY&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;timestamp=1672786364&amp;unique_k=bundi31&amp;up_id=520934274" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15g411i7Pq/?buvid=Z44748489E04119F419799276B7575E13D41&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=7kLWX1yZyjZouEfzrH3%2B